{"product_id":"walk-with-a-wolf","title":"Walk with a Wolf","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis is a non-fiction picture book by one of today's most acclaimed authors about one of the world's most magnificent creatures.Come with award-winning author Janni Howker on a spellbinding journey to the far, wild north, to the Yukon territory of north-western Canada, and meet one of the world's most magnificent, yet misunderstood, creatures: the wolf. Be part of the pack and walk, run, howl, hunt, eat, sleep and dream like a wolf.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 145 x 270\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Janni Howker\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781406313086\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45662154326169,"sku":"BLK-2-9781406313086","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68105b66de1c0_Walk_with_a_Wolf_Janni_Howker.jpg?v=1755876122","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/walk-with-a-wolf","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}